    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but i dont even know how to rewrite it. the script stays the same every day. i wake up, i do the work, i smile at people, i go home. and the grayness is just there. it's like this constant, heavy static. i just want it to be quiet. i just want the noise and the nothingness to finally stop.",
